<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$10.4 mln trade surplus in December.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$10.4 mln trade surplus in December.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for December:</p>
<p>(Figures are rounded)</p>
<p>Monthly series:</p>
<p>		Dec 1996	    Nov 1996	     Dec 1995</p>
<p>Balance     $10.4 million	  -$80.0 million	   -$7.2 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.71 bln	   $1.76 bln	    $1.69 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.70 bln	   $1.84 bln	    $1.70 bln</p>
</text>
